{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ca9e82ff-8e99-8371-a384-0b9c5fe5b1f6",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T10:54:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:52:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Maria Furtado. I'm calling about water in street, in front of my house. Three twenty-one Pelham Street, Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:52:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, three twenty-one Pelham. Is this from the storm last weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:52:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. It's Wednesday now. Still a pond out there. Street in front of house is a pond, Kevin. Cars drive through, throw wakes like boats."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:52:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, so it's still standing water, three days later. Is it sitting there, or does it drain a little and come back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:52:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sits. Goes down a little, comes back. And there's a manhole cover, looks off by an inch. Maybe sitting high on one side. Cars hit it, bang."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:53:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, manhole cover sitting a bit off, noted. Is that right in the middle of the water, or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right near it. Middle of the street, by my curb side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:53:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me write this down. Three twenty-one Pelham, standing water in the road since the weekend storm, plus a manhole cover that looks raised or shifted about an inch. Anything in the house, or just the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just street. But I have shop, customers. And I have car inspection appointment at three today. I have to get through that water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You can probably go around the other way, but I'd take it slow near that cover."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, I know. So, you open work order? For what date? I want a date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:53:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll open the request right now, so it's in the system today. As for the date a crew gets out, I can't give you one. I'll flag the manhole cover so they look at that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:54:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No date. Okay. Always no date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:54:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll put your number on it so someone can call you back. Is it four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Landline. Somebody there, I answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Somebody from the department should reach out. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Mrs. Furtado. Good luck with the inspection."
    }
  ],
